@startuml diagrama4

title PreviewPanda — Secuencia del workflow "Terraform Quality"

actor Desarrollador as Dev
participant "GitHub\n(Pull Request)" as PR
participant "GitHub Actions" as GA
participant "Terraform CLI" as TF
participant "TFLint" as Lint
participant "Checkov" as Checkov

Dev -> PR : abre el PR, hace push o lo reabre
PR -> GA : dispara ci.yml

== Preparar el runner ==

GA -> GA : checkout del repo
GA -> TF : instalar Terraform

== Revisar infra/preview ==

GA -> TF : fmt -check -recursive
TF --> GA : formato correcto o error

GA -> TF : init -reconfigure -backend=false
TF --> GA : proveedores inicializados

GA -> TF : validate
TF --> GA : configuración válida o error

GA -> Lint : instalar TFLint
GA -> Lint : tflint --init
GA -> Lint : tflint
Lint --> GA : resultado del lint

== Escanear infra/ ==

GA -> Checkov : escanear Terraform (soft_fail: true)
Checkov --> GA : informe de hallazgos

note over GA, Checkov
  Si falla un paso antes de Checkov, el job se detiene.
  Los hallazgos de Checkov se informan sin fallar el job.
end note

GA -> PR : resultado del check quality

@enduml
